review:
Great to see that we have the original classics on Steam now, even if it has the DRM. Now keep it up Capcom, just a few more titles to go:
- Resident Evil Survivor;
- Resident Evil CODE:Veronica;
- Resident Evil Survivor 2 CODE:Veronica;
- Resident Evil: Dead Aim;
- Resident Evil Outbreak;
- Resident Evil Outbreak File #2
Oh, and bring back Operation Raccoon City while were at it and port the Chronicles games to PC
